%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: SandroIntroDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Sorry, I was watching the light on the roof opposite. Sandro Kakhidze, mechanic on the south row.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 0}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: The work's changed. People bring things they can't afford to replace, asking me to keep them running. I don't always have parts.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 0}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: Does that frustrate you?
      npcResponse: Sometimes. There's something hopeful about fixing a thing that shouldn't work anymore.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
      playLaughSfx: 0
    - playerChoiceText: Busy workshop?
      npcResponse: It comes and goes. People either bring everything in or stop coming entirely.
      animationTrigger: TalkIdle
      playLaughSfx: 0
  - type: 0
    npcLine: I live with my partner, Irakli, six years now. He works nights so we don't overlap much. I left a book on a bench this morning.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 0}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: Same papers, different faces, or the other way around. My papers, October expiry. Thank you.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 0}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: I know what you mean.
      npcResponse: You see it in this booth. There's a poem in it somewhere.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
      playLaughSfx: 0
    - playerChoiceText: That's a poetic way to put it.
      npcResponse: My partner says I make everything a poem. He's not wrong.
      animationTrigger: TalkSmile
      playLaughSfx: 0
